1f:["$","p",null,{"children":["Two sections are ordered against the reading path without being part of it.\n",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/use-cases","children":"Why Forge"}]," comes before Getting started: what a remote cache and\nremote execution actually do, and a short check for whether your build is one\nthat benefits. It's worth ten minutes if you haven't decided yet.\n",["$","$L1b",null,{"href":"/operate","children":"Operate"}]," comes after How-to guides, for when other people\ndepend on your cluster and \"it works on my machine\" stops being the bar."]}]
20:["$","p",null,{"children":"Everything else sits outside the ordering: reference material you look things\nup in, explanations you read when you want to know why, and the contribution\nguides. Those are entered from a search or a link, at any point."}]
